5,1,1,talk,Minako,,We should start by gathering objective data to ensure a fair split. I suggest we look into the actual costs and usage patterns.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"A rational approach is certainly the most elegant. I'm curious about the human element, though; perhaps we should see how others managed this.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"I agree with the need for data, but we must focus on the daily reality of the car's availability and condition.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shion,,"Guesswork is inefficient. If we want a sustainable system, we need the actual figures and a clear picture of who is actually driving.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,Um... I just... I think it would be helpful to know how much time we actually spend managing the car.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Minako,,"@Benjamin, looking at other households is a good idea for a framework, but we need our own numbers first.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Quite right, Minako. I simply wish to avoid the psychological pitfalls that often accompany these ""fair"" arrangements.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Daisuke, time spent managing is less important than the state of the car when we actually need to leave the house.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Asuka, the ""state"" of the car is a variable. The financial cost is a constant. Let's prioritize the money.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,Sorry... I just feel like the organizing part is... a bit much sometimes.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Minako,,Let's be decisive. I will focus on the financial baseline and the actual usage hours to see where the imbalance lies.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I shall investigate the external perspectives and the specific patterns of our weekly habits. It might reveal the source of our friction.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I want to know about the car's condition at handover and the actual recorded hours of use. That's where the real issues are.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shion,,I'll take the fuel receipts and the tax and insurance papers. I want to see the total annual cost before we discuss percentages.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I... I'll look at the diary hours and maybe the trial of recording every run. If that's okay.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
